&lt;li&gt;Foster positive relationships with our customers as their primary contact, leading Professional Services engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist clients in implementing Neo4j technology by leveraging our professional services effectively and managing all delivery-related activities&lt;/li&gt;
