&lt;li&gt;Manage engagement budgeted hours, travel, and expenses, and coordinate with Finance for accurate billing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify up-selling and cross-selling opportunities with the engagement team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify engagement-related risks and communicate with stakeholders to secure successful mitigation plans&lt;/li&gt;
