&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Neo4j:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Neo4j is the graph intelligence platform that transforms data into knowledge to power the next generation of intelligent applications and AI systems. It includes enterprise-ready knowledge graphs for accurate, explainable, and governed AI; the most comprehensive, trusted, and easy-to-deploy graph capabilities across any environment and data source; and an unmatched ecosystem trusted by 84 of the Fortune 100 and supported by the world’s largest graph community.&amp;nbsp;Intelligence that works. Results that matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built to work everywhere and integrate with everything across every cloud for dynamic, personalized, and autonomous AI systems. We deliver quicker results, contextual knowledge, and solutions that impact customers and employees across the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Vision:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Neo4j, we have always strived to help the world make sense of data.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;As business, society and knowledge become increasingly connected, our technology promotes innovation by helping organizations to find and understand data relationships. We created, drive and lead the graph database category, and we’re disrupting how organizations leverage their data to innovate and stay competitive.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Minimum qualifications:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;1,0,0&quot;&gt;Must possess Singapore Citizenship, Permanent Residency (PR), or unrestricted working rights in Singapore.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;1,0,0&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;1,1,0&quot;&gt;7+ years of experience in a pre-sales engineering, professional services, or customer-facing technical architecture role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;1,2,0&quot;&gt;Experience in programming languages (e.g., Java, Python, JavaScript), containerisation (Docker, Kubernetes), and cloud infrastructure technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;1,3,0&quot;&gt;Experience engaging with, presenting to, and influencing both technical stakeholders and executive leaders (C-level) during complex sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;1,4,0&quot;&gt;Experience driving technical discovery and value-based selling to map enterprise business goals to technical architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel regionally up to 30-40% as this is a customer-facing role that requires interactions with local stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Preferred qualifications:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0&quot;&gt;Master’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, Mathematics, or a related technical field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0&quot;&gt;Deep expertise in graph database technologies (e.g., Neo4j) along with knowledge of relational, NoSQL, and data visualization tools (e.g., D3.js, Linkurious).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0&quot;&gt;Proven experience building joint GTM solutions and co-selling with hyperscalers (AWS, Azure, GCP), strategic ISVs, and global systems integrators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;3,3,0&quot;&gt;Industry expertise within highly regulated sectors such as Financial Services, Retail, Government, Security, or Telecommunications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;3,3,0&quot;&gt;Additional language skills - such as either Japanese, Mandarin, Cantonese, Bahasa, or Thai - would be advantageous, as this is a regional, client \-facing role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;3,3,0&quot;&gt;Willing to work in a hybrid role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;About the job&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;As a Senior Solutions Engineer, you will be a key driver of Neo4j’s growth across the APAC market by shaping technical solutions that address complex enterprise challenges. You will serve as the technical authority during the pre-sales lifecycle, moving beyond standard product demonstrations to architect robust, value-driven graph database solutions. You will engage deeply with customers and strategic partners—including hyperscalers like AWS, Azure, and Google Cloud—to design interconnected data ecosystems that prove the tangible ROI of the Neo4j portfolio. In this role, you will blend consultative technical prowess, sales acumen, and ecosystem collaboration to accelerate adoption and secure the technical win.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Neo4j is the world leader in graph database technology, helping organisations capture real-world context to drive choices for applications like artificial intelligence, fraud detection, and recommendation engines. We deliver enterprise-grade solutions that leverage connection-first data architectures to solve the world&#39;s most critical business problems. Turn your technical expertise into impact by helping APAC’s largest enterprises digitally transform their data landscapes.&lt;/p&gt;
