&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of backend development or software engineering experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in GoLang and Kubernetes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with at least one of the major cloud providers (GCP, AWS, Azure).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
